inants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}a & 2 & 10 \\\\ 0 & b & 12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{vmatrix} & =|\\begin{array}{cc|c}a & 2 & 10 \\\\ 0 & b & 12 \\\\ \\hline 0 & 0 & 4\\end{array}| \\\\  & =\\begin{vmatrix}a & 2 \\\\ 0 & b\\end{vmatrix}\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-5\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-20.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329634 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e2934b6-da54-5d53-98f7-fbe430d5e744" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327053} {:answer/id #uuid "26d292f5-32a6-5175-aec1-21401aba3b57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327270} {:answer/id #uuid "6f5bdb65-c453-5967-9ce8-7ccdc0e6c5c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327897} {:answer/id #uuid "bec35a1e-5a2c-5e67-83e9-f90ea3d2d3eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328601} {:answer/id #uuid "cc678f64-c03c-5c94-91be-b2f4e017e0d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328726}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186328601} :answer-field/id #uuid "0f8b7b10-83d3-52d4-948a-7e7e4e370fa9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186329208}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "f1190f94-94ed-5602-8000-c03537160c28" :question/math-academy-id "q-42139" :question/problem "Find \n$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{vmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & d & e \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1\\end{vmatrix}\n$$\ngiven that\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{vmatrix}d & e \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{vmatrix}=7.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & d & e \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1\\end{vmatrix} & =|\\b